WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:05.250
U-um...

00:05.250 --> 00:06.920
Who are you?

00:06.920 --> 00:09.540
An aristocrat just passing by.

00:09.880 --> 00:11.170
Got a problem with that?

00:11.790 --> 00:14.210
No, not really.

00:14.540 --> 00:16.580
Ah, I know!

00:16.580 --> 00:19.250
Why don't we have a pleasant little chat?

00:19.250 --> 00:21.920
Come, no need to be shy.

00:21.920 --> 00:23.710
Tonight is an informal event!

00:26.040 --> 00:29.250
Hilarious! That is so funny!

00:29.250 --> 00:32.420
The rumors are true,
you do act all happy-go-lucky!

00:32.710 --> 00:36.790
Then you're truly winning wars
because you give your subordinates

00:36.790 --> 00:38.670
the freedom to act as they wish?

00:38.670 --> 00:42.790
W-well, those guys are
so hot-blooded, they go stupid.

00:42.790 --> 00:45.880
They'll keep killing more and more enemies
if I just leave them alone.

00:46.210 --> 00:48.250
Even if you do nothing?

00:48.250 --> 00:49.250
Yeah!

00:49.250 --> 00:50.080
Uh, no!

00:50.080 --> 00:53.250
It's clear as day that if I made a move,

00:53.250 --> 00:56.130
victory would be mine in the blink of an eye!

00:56.130 --> 00:59.750
Certainly if you did anything,
it would be so glorious and exciting,

00:59.750 --> 01:03.460
it'd be like a one-sided massacre
event has started, but...

01:04.540 --> 01:06.540
Isn't that boring?

01:06.880 --> 01:10.000
Oh yeah, that's the annoying thing about it.

01:11.670 --> 01:14.000
That is absolutely right!

01:14.000 --> 01:16.710
Not killing each other for
the sake of killing your enemy,

01:16.710 --> 01:20.500
but killing each other to display
the might of your own country?

01:20.960 --> 01:24.080
I can't think of that as anything
but an insult to war.

01:24.080 --> 01:28.080
W-well, that's definitely another way
of thinking about it.

01:28.630 --> 01:29.920
True.

01:29.920 --> 01:33.790
And also, the biggest insult to war...

01:36.040 --> 01:38.710
is you, Terakomari.

01:39.420 --> 01:40.420
Huh?

01:41.960 --> 01:45.000
I cannot stomach the way you live.

01:45.000 --> 01:50.250
How can you nonchalantly act as a
Crimson Lord after all that you've done?

01:50.960 --> 01:54.380
Who are you to act so high and mighty?

01:54.830 --> 01:58.750
Do you enjoy being fussed over
by those around you that much?

01:58.750 --> 02:00.330
If only you weren't here...

02:00.330 --> 02:01.670
If you weren't here...

02:01.670 --> 02:03.540
If you weren't here now...

02:03.920 --> 02:05.500
E-excuse me.

02:05.920 --> 02:07.830
Oh dear, pardon me.

02:08.580 --> 02:12.170
My name is Millicent Bluenight.

02:20.210 --> 02:24.040
I've come to return what you
lent me three years ago.

02:26.830 --> 02:48.750
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

03:55.080 --> 04:00.170
<b>The Darkness of the Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

04:03.290 --> 04:04.250
Your Excellency!

04:17.290 --> 04:18.210
Your Excellency.

04:18.500 --> 04:19.670
Bellius!

04:22.580 --> 04:23.960
Oh, darn.

04:25.290 --> 04:27.040
I missed.

04:28.710 --> 04:31.420
She's an intruder! Where are the guards?!

04:31.420 --> 04:33.290
S-someone! Arrest that person!

04:33.290 --> 04:34.290
Lady Komari!

04:34.540 --> 04:35.580
Please get down!

04:44.380 --> 04:46.380
Ooh, yikes, I'm scared!

04:46.380 --> 04:48.710
I'll die if that hits me, you know?

04:50.960 --> 04:52.960
The next ones will meet their mark.

04:53.420 --> 04:54.670
You can't do this.

04:54.670 --> 04:56.420
You know that, right?

04:56.420 --> 04:59.130
I'm stronger than you.

05:02.380 --> 05:04.330
What's going on...

05:04.630 --> 05:07.580
What is this situation...?

05:08.080 --> 05:11.040
Was I almost killed?

05:11.040 --> 05:13.830
Did Bellius protect me?

05:14.580 --> 05:16.000
Hey, peon.

05:16.670 --> 05:22.080
You spoiling Our party is
so bold, I'm captivated.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.460
Are you ready to die?

05:24.670 --> 05:28.130
I didn't really have any intention
of ruining your party at all.

05:28.130 --> 05:30.170
All I wanted was to kill you,

05:30.170 --> 05:32.790
kill Armand Gandesblood,

05:32.790 --> 05:37.750
and then when I killed Terakomari
as she awkwardly trembled there,

05:37.750 --> 05:40.380
I would have been satisfied.

05:41.000 --> 05:44.330
I have no choice but to kill imbeciles
whose words make no sense.

05:44.330 --> 05:45.710
Die.

05:52.330 --> 05:53.500
Lady Komari!

05:57.380 --> 05:58.960
Boring.

05:58.960 --> 06:02.830
I want us to kill each other
when you're more serious about this.

06:02.830 --> 06:06.040
Wh-what do you mean?

06:07.500 --> 06:10.540
You could never understand how I feel.

06:11.460 --> 06:13.380
I don't care about things like that.

06:13.380 --> 06:16.330
I'm satisfied with my current circumstances.

06:17.330 --> 06:22.540
Joining Inverse Moon and being pursued
by the nation was my destiny.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.920
You're part of Inverse Moon?

06:24.920 --> 06:26.330
Yes, and what about it?

06:26.330 --> 06:30.170
You profess yourself as one who believes that
"death is the true desire of the living,"

06:30.170 --> 06:33.920
so you're planning on destroying
each country's Dark Core, correct?

06:33.920 --> 06:37.380
Terakomari, I'll kill you next.

06:39.750 --> 06:42.080
I'll give you a taste of a genuine death

06:42.080 --> 06:46.250
where revival by the Dark Core is impossible.

06:46.710 --> 06:48.710
You cannot escape, you reckless fool!

06:54.580 --> 06:56.080
Lady Komari!

06:56.080 --> 06:57.920
Are you injured?!

06:59.790 --> 07:01.420
Why...

07:01.750 --> 07:04.000
Why is she here?

07:04.380 --> 07:06.000
I haven't done anything wrong, so why...

07:06.000 --> 07:07.330
Lady Komari...
I haven't done anything wrong, so why...<b></b>

07:07.330 --> 07:09.000
I haven't done anything wrong, so why...

07:10.670 --> 07:13.420
Why is she still...

07:13.420 --> 07:15.920
coming to bully me?

07:18.000 --> 07:19.960
<b>One week later</b>

07:20.540 --> 07:22.670
We will annihilate Inverse Moon!

07:22.670 --> 07:23.880
Without delay!

07:23.880 --> 07:25.670
Doing so without levelheadedness
will only lead to

07:25.670 --> 07:27.460
being slain by the target
of your vengeance.

07:28.630 --> 07:30.380
Have you forgotten?

07:30.380 --> 07:33.080
The attacker used a ritual article.

07:33.080 --> 07:36.630
Injuries sustained from ritual articles
that hold equal power to the Dark Core

07:36.630 --> 07:39.920
cannot receive the revival effect from it.

07:40.290 --> 07:44.380
At the very worst,
you will face genuine death.

07:44.380 --> 07:47.460
What is the Court doing to begin with?!

07:47.460 --> 07:50.540
The Court is having meeting upon meeting,
from morning to evening.

07:50.540 --> 07:51.960
For what?

07:52.250 --> 07:54.960
There may be a spy hidden among us.

07:55.380 --> 07:56.500
A spy?

07:56.830 --> 08:00.380
It seems a transfer gate was
constructed at the party venue.

08:00.960 --> 08:05.960
It cannot work unless there are two gates
made before the transference.

08:06.380 --> 08:09.460
In other words, before the incident,

08:09.460 --> 08:12.670
there was someone who snuck into
the party venue and set up the gate.

08:13.130 --> 08:14.330
I see.

08:14.630 --> 08:18.040
Let's gather the troops and
commence operations immediately.

08:18.330 --> 08:23.710
Lady Komari has advised us to
stand by until she returns.

08:23.710 --> 08:25.920
Well, where is Her Excellency right now?

08:25.920 --> 08:28.420
Observing the movement of the enemy.

08:28.420 --> 08:31.830
She would not even tell me,
her close adviser, the location.

08:31.830 --> 08:33.460
Hold on right there.

08:33.460 --> 08:37.630
Lieutenant Villhaze, I cannot just
ignore that statement, you know.

08:37.630 --> 08:41.040
Her close adviser happens to be me,
Caostel Conto.

08:42.420 --> 08:45.710
Do you know the color of
Lady Komari's underwear?

08:47.080 --> 08:48.540
You don't, do you?

08:48.540 --> 08:51.040
Therefore, I am her close adviser.

08:52.170 --> 08:56.210
In any case, you must not make a move
until there is some sort of

08:56.210 --> 08:59.040
correspondence from Lady Komari.

09:01.960 --> 09:05.380
At first I thought it was something trivial..

09:05.380 --> 09:10.670
At unexpected moments of doing nothing,
I'd provoke Millicent's hatred,

09:10.670 --> 09:15.250
and before I realized it, it had become
something that I couldn't recover from.

09:18.920 --> 09:23.290
But even so, I never gave in.

09:24.710 --> 09:29.580
They could only feel joy by
hurting other people,

09:29.580 --> 09:32.210
and they were so pitiful...

09:32.460 --> 09:35.460
I continued enduring it all
while thinking that.

09:36.420 --> 09:37.670
However...

09:39.290 --> 09:42.540
Say... Let me see that pendant.

09:43.380 --> 09:46.000
The memento from my mother?!

09:46.000 --> 09:49.210
And then, I snapped.

09:54.830 --> 09:57.040
How dare you...

09:57.040 --> 10:00.960
Look at that, she's got a nosebleed.

10:02.670 --> 10:04.210
Oh, yeah.

10:04.750 --> 10:07.960
I'll let you be for just one of your pinkies.

10:18.630 --> 10:21.290
I don't remember what happened after that.

10:21.750 --> 10:26.540
When I came to, I was worn out
and laying on my bed at home.

10:26.960 --> 10:30.080
My true nature isn't one of a Crimson Lord.

10:30.080 --> 10:34.250
There's no escaping how embarrassing
it is to say this, but I'm just a recluse.

10:34.880 --> 10:36.380
So that's why...

10:36.380 --> 10:40.880
That's why I'm never leaving this place again.

10:44.830 --> 10:46.500
Excuse me.

10:48.630 --> 10:51.750
Lady Komari, how are you feeling?

10:52.420 --> 10:53.580
Vill...

10:53.830 --> 10:56.750
Omelette rice is on the menu
for this evening's meal.

10:56.750 --> 10:57.920
You like that, right?

11:05.710 --> 11:08.500
Some sacrifices must be made.

11:12.460 --> 11:14.460
Her Excellency's hair...

11:14.750 --> 11:18.040
a supremely fine item is finally in my hands!

11:18.040 --> 11:21.710
I can locate her with my magic...

11:21.710 --> 11:26.380
though at the same time, it turns into
magical energy and disappears...

11:27.330 --> 11:28.830
Attraction web!

11:36.500 --> 11:38.040
I've found her.

11:40.040 --> 11:44.420
Vill, why are you worried about me?

11:44.920 --> 11:46.540
Is it not obvious?

11:46.540 --> 11:50.420
Because I love you more than
anyone else in the universe.

11:50.420 --> 11:52.290
I don't get why.

11:52.290 --> 11:55.250
Vill, am I your long lost
little sister or something?

11:55.250 --> 11:56.670
No.

11:56.670 --> 11:59.540
We're not sisters or anything of the sort.

11:59.540 --> 12:01.000
Then why...

12:06.580 --> 12:09.830
All of my emotions are written down here.

12:09.830 --> 12:12.460
Please read when you have the time.

12:12.920 --> 12:15.670
I will... when I feel up to it...

12:18.460 --> 12:23.380
Lady Komari. There are a lot of people
that are worried about you.

12:24.460 --> 12:28.380
The amount of people that worry about you

12:28.380 --> 12:32.630
without considering things like your
aptitude as a commander or your smarts...

12:32.630 --> 12:34.710
there are more than you kno-

12:44.330 --> 12:47.290
Good evening, Terakomari.

12:49.880 --> 12:51.880
Lady... Komari...

13:09.380 --> 13:10.960
Relax.

13:10.960 --> 13:13.500
This sword isn't a ritual article.

13:13.500 --> 13:15.830
Leave her alone and she'll recuperate.

13:16.290 --> 13:18.040
Why are you here?

13:18.040 --> 13:19.420
I told you, didn't I?

13:19.420 --> 13:21.420
I said I'd come see you again.

13:26.130 --> 13:27.250
Vill!

13:30.040 --> 13:31.830
If you scream, I'll kill you.

13:31.830 --> 13:33.710
If you get violent, I'll kill you.

13:33.710 --> 13:38.210
Just sit still over there
and listen to what I have to say.

13:40.540 --> 13:42.880
Just like that. Good girl.

13:43.460 --> 13:45.670
Now then, getting down to business...

13:45.670 --> 13:49.210
I didn't come here to kill you.

13:49.210 --> 13:53.540
I'm preparing to direct
an even more tragic murder.

13:53.880 --> 13:55.540
Preparing?

13:55.540 --> 13:58.960
There're all sorts of things to get
in my way around here, right?

13:58.960 --> 14:00.540
That's why...

14:01.380 --> 14:05.290
I want you to come to the place
I'll tell you about now.

14:05.290 --> 14:08.630
You're in no condition to
come here voluntarily, are you?

14:08.630 --> 14:11.330
Well, that's to be expected.

14:11.670 --> 14:15.880
You were always scum,
and a crybaby, and indecisive.

14:16.500 --> 14:20.540
And yet, you had more of a
useless sense of justice than most.

14:20.540 --> 14:21.750
That's why...

14:21.750 --> 14:23.540
I'm going to do this.

14:23.540 --> 14:26.380
Just like I did that time, three years ago.

14:27.580 --> 14:29.630
I'm taking her with me.

14:29.630 --> 14:36.290
If you want her back, come to
"La Nelient City Castle Ruins" by midnight.

14:37.130 --> 14:40.460
If you're even a second late,
I'll kill Villhaze.

14:40.790 --> 14:44.210
Oh, you'll need to come alone, of course.

14:44.210 --> 14:47.040
If you tell anyone about this...

14:47.830 --> 14:49.580
you know the rest, right?

14:50.420 --> 14:52.540
Okay, it's a promise.

15:15.380 --> 15:17.210
I'm done.

15:17.210 --> 15:19.710
I'm going to stay shut-in like this forever.

15:20.630 --> 15:25.330
I don't care what happens to
that perverted maid.

15:29.130 --> 15:33.040
I shouldn't... care...

15:34.670 --> 15:36.000
But...

15:37.420 --> 15:41.290
Vill never abandoned me.

15:58.170 --> 15:59.580
Dear Lady Komari,

15:59.580 --> 16:02.210
The season of the hidden moon
has passed us by,

16:02.210 --> 16:06.130
and recently, I can hear the sound of
the footsteps of a full-blown summer.

16:06.130 --> 16:08.250
How are things with you?

16:08.750 --> 16:13.130
Well now, I'll stop the superfluous
introduction and get into the real matter.

16:13.710 --> 16:18.380
We first met three years go.

16:18.380 --> 16:19.880
Surprising, right?

16:20.330 --> 16:25.830
When I was attending the imperial academy,
I was a hopelessly poor student.

16:26.420 --> 16:30.710
It's the law of nature that
the weak like this are oppressed,

16:30.710 --> 16:35.540
and naturally, I was tormented
by my classmates.

16:36.380 --> 16:40.420
The principal offender of my torment
was Millicent Bluenight.

16:47.630 --> 16:50.830
Hey Milly, we're done with her.

16:50.830 --> 16:52.130
She's broken.

16:52.130 --> 16:54.710
It's no fun when they don't react.

16:54.710 --> 16:56.540
Then should we kill her?

16:56.540 --> 16:57.580
Huh?

17:04.330 --> 17:06.830
I'm gonna blow her head off!

17:07.630 --> 17:09.710
Stop... it...

17:12.880 --> 17:13.880
Stop!

17:15.290 --> 17:19.920
Dark, cold despair befell me every day.

17:21.000 --> 17:26.330
The ray of light that appeared in
the midst of it all was you, Lady Komari.

17:27.540 --> 17:32.750
However, after that, things took
a turn for the absolute worst.

17:38.880 --> 17:43.170
Even though I witnessed you undergoing
unjust treatment, Lady Komari,

17:43.630 --> 17:48.790
I couldn't do what you once did
and take that first step.

17:49.750 --> 17:51.540
This is my sin.

17:51.540 --> 17:54.290
While I was being saved,

17:54.290 --> 17:58.630
I was a coward who didn't return the favor.

17:58.630 --> 18:03.040
You became a shut-in,
and up until Millicent disappeared,

18:03.040 --> 18:07.130
I couldn't do a thing except
hide from view and tremble.

18:08.790 --> 18:12.330
That is precisely why
I decided to redeem myself.

18:13.000 --> 18:18.330
It's crazy that someone so kind should
have their life ruined by a miscreant.

18:18.330 --> 18:19.830
It's wrong.

18:20.500 --> 18:23.250
After I graduated the academy,
my heart's desire was granted,

18:23.250 --> 18:27.580
and I was employed as maid
in the Gandesblood residence.

18:27.920 --> 18:31.580
Every time your induction into
the Seven Crimson Lords came up,

18:31.580 --> 18:34.210
I came forward as a candidate to support you.

18:35.500 --> 18:37.710
I have written it all out at length,

18:37.710 --> 18:40.710
but there is not a lot that I
want to convey to you.

18:41.290 --> 18:43.670
Lady Komari, you are a wonderful person.

18:44.040 --> 18:50.380
You are stronger, kinder,
and shine brighter than anyone else.

18:51.330 --> 18:57.330
Whatever Millicent, who has just returned,
says to you, ignore her.

18:57.710 --> 19:01.170
If that seems to be difficult,
please lean on me.

19:01.460 --> 19:04.380
Though I was once someone
who betrayed you,

19:04.380 --> 19:07.960
I will not commit a mistake like that again.

19:08.460 --> 19:12.790
If you say you do not want to proceed,
I will not force you to do so.

19:12.790 --> 19:15.420
I will stay close to you
until you feel comfortable.

19:15.420 --> 19:21.630
Making you happy will be
my atonement and my desire.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.330
Vill...

19:25.960 --> 19:29.460
Why can't I remember this?

19:29.460 --> 19:32.210
It's crazy that I'd forget...

19:32.750 --> 19:34.250
Darn it!

19:37.790 --> 19:39.670
Ah, Your Excellency!

19:39.670 --> 19:42.000
I can finally see you!

19:42.000 --> 19:45.540
I'm sorry, I was shutting myself away.

19:45.830 --> 19:47.670
That was a joke, right?

19:47.670 --> 19:52.290
You're here because it's finally time to launch
a counterattack on Inverse Moon, yes?

19:52.540 --> 19:56.420
The troops have been
anxiously awaiting this as well.

20:03.210 --> 20:04.080
Yeah.

20:04.380 --> 20:05.630
Bellius!

20:05.630 --> 20:08.710
I, Bellius Hund Cerbero,
though unworthy,

20:08.710 --> 20:11.750
will follow Your Excellency
wherever you may go.

20:11.750 --> 20:13.830
Caostel Conto will also follow you.

20:13.830 --> 20:15.040
Yeah.

20:15.500 --> 20:16.710
Thanks.

20:17.080 --> 20:19.750
I feel motivated to do this
thanks to all of you.

20:20.080 --> 20:25.670
And so, I'm going to go settle this
with the aforementioned terrorist now.

20:25.670 --> 20:28.830
Then you know where the enemy is, right?

20:28.830 --> 20:29.790
Yeah.

20:29.790 --> 20:33.460
But I won't allow you all to accompany me.

20:33.460 --> 20:34.630
You can't be serious!

20:34.630 --> 20:36.290
Your Excellency! Why not?!

20:36.630 --> 20:39.710
My apologies. This is my battle.

20:40.500 --> 20:42.960
You all pray for your
supreme commander's success

20:42.960 --> 20:46.170
as you stand by in the Crimson Lords' office.

20:47.040 --> 20:48.830
All of you just doing that...

20:49.630 --> 20:52.670
will give me a lot of courage.

20:55.330 --> 20:56.750
H-hey...

20:57.080 --> 20:58.750
What is that?

20:58.750 --> 21:00.500
Can't you tell?

21:00.500 --> 21:02.380
This is Villhaze.

21:02.380 --> 21:04.580
The Gandesblood's maid.

21:04.580 --> 21:09.210
I know that! What I'm asking
is why is she here?!

21:09.210 --> 21:11.630
Is it not obvious she's a hostage?

21:11.630 --> 21:14.670
So she's a terrorist after all.

21:14.670 --> 21:17.500
I should never have worked with
someone like her.

21:20.080 --> 21:24.540
Say, if you happen to kill Terakomari, then I-

21:26.920 --> 21:29.040
Wh-what are you doing?!

21:29.040 --> 21:32.380
That's a ritual article, right?!
She'll actually die!

21:32.380 --> 21:34.170
Actually die?

21:34.170 --> 21:36.710
You don't know what you're
talking about, do you?

21:39.080 --> 21:43.290
Seems like your awareness as
an accomplice to Inverse Moon is lacking.

21:45.170 --> 21:47.290
Then I'll ask you this:

21:47.290 --> 21:50.290
What meaning is there in killing
when death doesn't follow it?

21:50.290 --> 21:51.710
Answer me.

21:52.330 --> 21:54.830
I-it's useful in war and st-

22:01.420 --> 22:03.420
If you say idiotic things,

22:04.080 --> 22:05.630
I'll kill you.

22:13.790 --> 22:17.210
Nice to see you've made it, Terakomari.

23:58.960 --> 24:00.790
"The Mercy of the Lonely Crimson."

25:07.170 --> 25:11.000
<b>The Mercy of the Lonely Crimson</b>
